{"data": {"event": {"id": "3cab9681-0858-48fb-9fd5-550ece755aed", "picture": null, "sessionType": "S\u00e9ance de cas cliniques", "sessionTypeColor": "#44fce7", "voting": true, "title": "S\u00e9ance de cas cliniques\u00a0 : une nuit de garde avec la SFR-Urgences", "start": "2026-10-09T14:00+02:00", "end": "2026-10-09T15:00+02:00", "objectives": ["<ul type=\"disc\">", "\t<li>Illustrer, \u00e0 partir de cas cliniques r\u00e9els, les principales situations rencontr\u00e9es au cours d\u2019une garde de radiologie d\u2019urgence.<o:p></o:p></li>", "\t<li>Discuter les strat\u00e9gies d\u2019imagerie adapt\u00e9es selon les contextes organisationnels et les contraintes de permanence des soins.<o:p></o:p></li>", "\t<li>Identifier les pi\u00e8ges diagnostiques fr\u00e9quents en imagerie d\u2019urgence et les \u00e9l\u00e9ments cl\u00e9s permettant de les \u00e9viter.<o:p></o:p></li>", "\t<li>Optimiser la prise en charge radiologique des urgences vitales (polytraumatisme, h\u00e9morragies, urgences abdominales et neurologiques).<o:p></o:p></li>", "\t<li>Comparer les pratiques et organisations entre diff\u00e9rents centres hospitaliers afin d\u2019am\u00e9liorer la qualit\u00e9 et la s\u00e9curit\u00e9 des soins en garde</li>", "</ul>", "<p><o:p>Texte de pr\u00e9sentation</o:p></p>", "<p>Et si vous passiez une nuit de garde avec les radiologues d\u2019urgence de toute la france et la suisse ?<o:p></o:p></p>", "<p>\u00c0 travers une s\u00e9rie de cas cliniques immersifs et interactifs, cette s\u00e9ance vous plonge au c\u0153ur du quotidien des gardes de radiologie d\u2019urgence : polytraumatismes, h\u00e9morragies, pi\u00e8ges diagnostiques, d\u00e9cisions rapides sous pression et organisation en flux tendu.<o:p></o:p></p>", "<p>De Montpellier \u00e0 d\u2019autres centres hospitaliers fran\u00e7ais et au Hopitaux Universitaires Genevois, d\u00e9couvrez comment les radiologues experts g\u00e8rent les situations critiques, adaptent leurs protocoles et prennent les bonnes d\u00e9cisions au bon moment. Une session dynamique, concr\u00e8te et rythm\u00e9e, pens\u00e9e pour tous les radiologues souhaitant confronter leurs pratiques \u00e0 la r\u00e9alit\u00e9 du terrain.<o:p></o:p></p>"], "onAir": null, "vod": {"checkPermissions": ["media:view"], "media": null}, "broadcasts": {"items": []}, "room": {"id": "628607c6-3f4e-46f9-9bdf-24778538e3f3", "name": "Amphith\u00e9\u00e2tre Bordeaux", "type": "ROOM"}, "schedule": {"items": [{"id": "2d9f6c76-ce14-4180-a06b-7212d8b4e6f8", "title": "A Poitiers -  Garde m\u00e9dico-chirurgicale", "start": "2026-10-09T14:00+02:00", "end": "2026-10-09T14:20+02:00", "element": {"abstract": null}, "speakers": {"items": [{"id": "da6adabe-20af-4a75-bc05-53203f26ebef", "lastName": "Herpe", "firstName": "Guillaume", "roles": [{"name": "speaker"}], "photo": {"url": "https://services.y-congress.com/congress/wspreview/getphoto.aspx?idPhoto=236765&t=1"}, "country": {"name": "France"}, "city": {"name": "Poitiers"}}, {"id": "0ac4b2ae-fcac-4252-a871-287e359edac1", "lastName": "Noguero", "firstName": "Antoine", "roles": [{"name": "speaker"}], "photo": {"url": "https://services.y-congress.com/congress/wspreview/getphoto.aspx?idPhoto=236859&t=1"}, "country": {"name": "France"}, "city": {"name": "Poitiers"}}]}, "vod": {"checkPermissions": ["media:view"], "media": null}}, {"id": "713b791a-edf8-4e52-8cca-438fa7116a92", "title": "A Gen\u00e8ve -  Garde Internationale", "start": "2026-10-09T14:20+02:00", "end": "2026-10-09T14:40+02:00", "element": {"abstract": null}, "speakers": {"items": [{"id": "0dc6ae47-fc67-4231-bb02-7245aeef9e3f", "lastName": "Michaud", "firstName": "Pierre", "roles": [{"name": "speaker"}], "photo": null, "country": {"name": "Suisse"}, "city": {"name": "Gen\u00e8ve"}}, {"id": "d30bd285-a829-4abd-9eb6-879c5670f2a7", "lastName": "Platon", "firstName": "Alexandra", "roles": [{"name": "speaker"}], "photo": null, "country": {"name": "Suisse"}, "city": {"name": "Gen\u00e8ve"}}]}, "vod": {"checkPermissions": ["media:vi